(7197671, 1107422, 86447, '<td valign="top">7 from me.  I love the colors and that lone cow.  I see the difficulty you had in the crop...  if you take out the cow, then the charm is gone, if you crop it more conventionally, the fence isn''t as strong.   Hence the odd border and size.<br/> <br/>It probably would have gotten a 9 from me if the horizon were not almost in the middle and the crop were different.   Still... it''s a 7.  and a good one.  :D</td>', '7 from me.  I love the colors and that lone cow.  I see the difficulty you had in the crop...  if you take out the cow, then the charm is gone, if you crop it more conventionally, the fence isn''t as strong.   Hence the odd border and size. It probably would have gotten a 9 from me if the horizon were not almost in the middle and the crop were different.   Still... it''s a 7.  and a good one.  :D', '2014-04-02 13:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
