(7197688, 1107884, 86447, '<td valign="top">I can''t decide whether we needed to see the foreground fence or if it lessens the beauty of the background too much.  It certainly fits the challenge this way, but it would have fit the other way too.  7</td>', 'I can''t decide whether we needed to see the foreground fence or if it lessens the beauty of the background too much.  It certainly fits the challenge this way, but it would have fit the other way too.  7', '2014-04-02 13:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7197690, 1107570, 86447, '<td valign="top">I wish the girl weren''t there.   <br/> <br/>Usually, I would want her.   But, in this case... the quirkiness and unexpectedness of the pigs behind the grate is enough to be a really great subject.  Adding in the girl just confuses me (I''m not that bright) and lessens the impact of the pigs and that great texture of the wall, in my opinion.  <br/> <br/>A 7 from me.  Probably a nine without the girl.  Sorry!!</td>', 'I wish the girl weren''t there.    Usually, I would want her.   But, in this case... the quirkiness and unexpectedness of the pigs behind the grate is enough to be a really great subject.  Adding in the girl just confuses me (I''m not that bright) and lessens the impact of the pigs and that great texture of the wall, in my opinion.   A 7 from me.  Probably a nine without the girl.  Sorry!!', '2014-04-02 13:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
