(7201657, 1107790, 138630, '<td valign="top">I gave this one of my top scores (9 and I only had two 10''s in the challenge) and hoped it would be higher - but I was afraid it wasn''t "fence" enough for many.  I do adore the depth of field and though I am not usually all that fond of selective color, I think it works nicely here.  Nice finish.</td>', 'I gave this one of my top scores (9 and I only had two 10''s in the challenge) and hoped it would be higher - but I was afraid it wasn''t "fence" enough for many.  I do adore the depth of field and though I am not usually all that fond of selective color, I think it works nicely here.  Nice finish.', '2014-04-10 14:56:28.000000', NULL, 0),
