(7230781, 1107517, 129807, '<td valign="top">Yep, this is definitely a picture of a fence! I like what you did with the juxtaposition of ''subjects''; I think that for the dpc crowd you missed the brief on this one, which in my mind was to make the fence (a somewhat mundane object) the star of the shot.</td>', 'Yep, this is definitely a picture of a fence! I like what you did with the juxtaposition of ''subjects''; I think that for the dpc crowd you missed the brief on this one, which in my mind was to make the fence (a somewhat mundane object) the star of the shot.', '2014-06-19 03:25:36.000000', NULL, 0),
