(7419833, 1107170, 150277, '<td valign="top">I thought this was a very good image for the challenge. I gave it a 6.  The black of the mirror, especially on the right side of the image took away a bit from the overall impact of the image for me since it was so prominent.  I would also say that I felt the scene was a bit ordinary.  Aside from the interesting choice to use the mirror, I did not find anything particularly striking about the scene that would make the image even more memorable to me.</td>', 'I thought this was a very good image for the challenge. I gave it a 6.  The black of the mirror, especially on the right side of the image took away a bit from the overall impact of the image for me since it was so prominent.  I would also say that I felt the scene was a bit ordinary.  Aside from the interesting choice to use the mirror, I did not find anything particularly striking about the scene that would make the image even more memorable to me.', '2015-12-02 09:14:25.000000', NULL, 0),
